OL,3,GNEWSARob Callister appointed Minister
OL,4,Afor Housing and Communities
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnchan MHK Rob Callister has been
OL,7,Fappointed as Minister for Housing and
OL,8,FCommunities.
OL,10,FIt is a new position within the Council
OL,11,Fof Ministers created by Chief Minister
OL,12,FChris Thomas.
OL,14,FCallister will lead the development of
OL,15,Fa housing action plan to provide up to
OL,16,F1,000 affordable homes over ten years.
OL,18,F"Housing is one of the biggest
OL,19,Fchallenges facing the Isle of Man, and
OL,20,FI am delighted to take on the role of
OL,21,FMinister for Housing and Communities,"
OL,22,FCallister said.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
